tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\Bigl(D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\Bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Meeting one dense set is a local property; genericity over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> requires meeting every dense <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in M\">\\(D\\in M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This proposition records the immediate specialization to one such <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dense","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dense]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dense","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)$ (dense subset predicate, see [[58-df-dense]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,P,\\le_P,D,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\Bigl(D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\le_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\Bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":824,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","an